"Back to Momento":"返去 Momento",
"Last updated %1 November %2":"最後更新：%2 年 11 月 %1 日",
"Momento (hexarch.org) is a shared photo album for events, run by HexArch Limited. This page explains what we collect, why, where it's kept and how to have it deleted. We don't sell your information, we don't show ads, and we don't use your photos for anything except showing them to the people in your album.":"Momento（hexarch.org）係由 HexArch Limited 營運嘅活動共享相簿。呢頁解釋我哋收集咩、點解收集、存喺邊，同點樣刪除。我哋唔會賣你嘅資料，唔會賣廣告，除咗畀你相簿入面嘅人睇之外，唔會將你啲相用嚟做其他嘢。",
"What we collect":"我哋收集嘅資料",
"What":"內容",
"Why":"原因",
"Your name and email":"你嘅名同電郵",
"To create your account, show other album members who added each photo, and send you account emails.":"用嚟開你個帳戶、話畀其他相簿成員知每張相係邊個加，同埋發帳戶電郵畀你。",
"Stored only as a one-way scrambled hash; we can never see it.":"只會以單向加密雜湊值儲存；我哋永遠睇唔到。",
"Google account details":"Google 帳戶資料",
"If you use “Continue with Google”: your name, email, profile picture and Google account ID, so you can sign in. We don't get your Google password or anything else in your Google account.":"如果你用「用 Google 繼續」：我哋會攞你嘅名、電郵、頭像同 Google 帳戶 ID，等你可以登入。我哋唔會攞你嘅 Google 密碼或者 Google 帳戶入面任何其他嘢。",
"Photos you upload":"你上載嘅相",
"To share them with the people in that album. Before storing a photo we remove its hidden details (EXIF, XMP and IPTC), including any GPS location.":"用嚟同嗰個相簿入面嘅人分享。儲存相之前，我哋會移除入面嘅隱藏資料（EXIF、XMP 同 IPTC），包括任何 GPS 位置。",
"Albums you create":"你建立嘅相簿",
"The album's name, date and times, the venue you choose on the map and its sharing zone, so guests can join and add photos at the event.":"相簿嘅名、日期同時間、你喺地圖揀嘅場地同分享範圍，等訪客可以喺活動入面加入同加相。",
"Your location, when uploading":"上載時嘅位置",
"For albums with a sharing zone, your browser asks before sharing your location with us, and we use it only to check you're near the venue. We don't store it.":"對於有分享範圍嘅相簿，你個瀏覽器會先問過你先至同我哋分享位置，我哋淨係用嚟確認你喺場地附近，唔會儲存。",
"Used only while you take a photo or scan a QR code in Momento. Photos taken in Momento go straight to the album; nothing is recorded or kept otherwise.":"只會喺你用 Momento 影相或者掃二維碼時使用。喺 Momento 影嘅相會直接入相簿；除此之外唔會錄低或者保留任何嘢。",
"Login records":"登入記錄",
"When you last logged in and which devices are logged in, so you can stay signed in and we can sign out old devices.":"你上次幾時登入同邊啲機登入咗，等你可以保持登入，我哋都可以登出舊機。",
"Messages to support":"發畀支援嘅訊息",
"What you send through the support form, so we can reply.":"你用支援表格發嘅嘢，等我哋可以回覆。",
"Who can see your photos":"邊個可以睇到你啲相",
"Only people who have joined the album (with its code or QR code) can see and download its photos. Anyone you give the code to can join, so share it with care. The album's host can remove any photo in their album, and you can remove the photos you added.":"只有加入咗相簿（用代碼或者二維碼）嘅人先睇到同下載到入面啲相。你將代碼畀邊個，邊個都可以加入，所以分享時要小心。相簿主辦人可以刪除相簿入面任何相，你都可以刪除自己加嘅相。",
"Cookies and storage in your browser":"瀏覽器入面嘅 Cookie 同儲存",
"{0}, so you stay signed in. It can't be read by the page's scripts and is only sent to Momento.":"{0}，等你保持登入。頁面嘅腳本讀唔到佢，佢亦只會發去 Momento。",
"A login cookie":"一個登入 Cookie",
"{0} saved in your browser, such as light or dark mode.":"{0}儲存喺你嘅瀏覽器，例如淺色或者深色模式。",
"Small settings":"少量設定",
"We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.":"我哋唔用廣告或者追蹤 Cookie。",
"Services we use":"我哋用嘅服務",
"To run Momento we rely on these providers, who handle data only to provide their service to us:":"為咗運作 Momento，我哋依賴以下服務供應商，佢哋處理資料只係為咗向我哋提供服務：",
"{0} (Sydney, Australia): runs Momento's server, stores the photos and sends our emails.":"{0}（澳洲悉尼）：運行 Momento 嘅伺服器、儲存相同發送我哋嘅電郵。",
"{0}: stores accounts, albums and photo details (not the photo files).":"{0}：儲存帳戶、相簿同相片資料（唔包括相片檔案）。",
"{0}: “Continue with Google” sign-in, the reCAPTCHA “I'm not a robot” check on sign-up, and the map for choosing a venue. Google's {1} and {2} apply to those.":"{0}：「用 Google 繼續」登入、註冊時嘅 reCAPTCHA「我唔係機械人」驗證，同揀場地用嘅地圖。呢啲服務適用 Google 嘅{1}同{2}。",
"Privacy Policy":"私隱政策",
"Terms of Service":"服務條款",
"{0}: delivers the website's pages.":"{0}：提供網站頁面。",
"Emails":"電郵",
"We send account emails (confirming your address, resetting your password, changing your email) and album emails a host triggers (invites and reminders). You can choose which album notifications you get in Settings. We don't send marketing emails.":"我哋會發帳戶電郵（確認地址、重設密碼、更改電郵）同主辦人觸發嘅相簿電郵（邀請同提醒）。你可以喺設定度揀收邊啲相簿通知。我哋唔會發推廣電郵。",
"How long we keep things":"我哋保留幾耐",
"Your account and its details stay until you delete it.":"你個帳戶同入面嘅資料會一直保留，直到你刪除為止。",
"Albums and their photos stay until the host deletes the album or their account. After an event, albums stop taking new photos but stay available to view and download.":"相簿同入面啲相會一直保留，直到主辦人刪除相簿或者佢個帳戶。活動完咗之後，相簿唔再收新相，但仍然可以睇同下載。",
"One-time links in emails (confirm, reset) stop working after use or after they expire.":"電郵入面嘅一次性連結（確認、重設）用完或者過期之後就會失效。",
"Deleting your account":"刪除你個帳戶",
"You can delete your account in Settings. That permanently removes your account, the albums you host (with all their photos) and the photos you added to other albums. This can't be undone, so download anything you want to keep first.":"你可以喺設定度刪除帳戶。咁會永久刪除你個帳戶、你主辦嘅相簿（連晒入面啲相）同你加去其他相簿嘅相。冇得復原，所以想留低嘅記得先下載。",
"Your choices and rights":"你嘅選擇同權利",
"You can see and change your name and email in Settings, and download a copy of your information there (Download my data). You can also ask us for a copy of your information, a correction, or its deletion, by emailing {0}. We'll reply as soon as we can.":"你可以喺設定度睇同改你嘅名同電郵，亦可以喺嗰度下載你嘅資料副本（下載我嘅資料）。你都可以電郵去 {0}，要求我哋提供你嘅資料副本、更正或者刪除。我哋會盡快回覆。",
"Children":"兒童",
"Momento isn't meant for children under 13, and they shouldn't create an account.":"Momento 唔係為 13 歲以下兒童而設，佢哋唔應該開帳戶。",
"Changes":"更改",
"If we change this policy, we'll update this page and the date at the top. For bigger changes we'll let account holders know by email.":"如果我哋改呢份政策，會更新呢頁同頂部嘅日期。大改動會電郵通知帳戶持有人。",
