"Location is off for Momento. On iPhone or iPad: Settings → Privacy & Security → Location Services: turn it on, open Safari Websites and choose While Using the App. Then in Safari tap “aA” → Website Settings → Location → Allow, and try again.":"Momento 嘅位置權限已關閉。喺 iPhone 或 iPad：設定 → 私隱與保安 → 定位服務：開啟佢，打開「Safari 網站」再揀「使用 App 期間」。然後喺 Safari 撳「aA」→「網站設定」→「位置」→「允許」，再試一次。",
"On a Mac: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Location Services: turn it on, and switch on your browser in the list.":"喺 Mac：系統設定 → 私隱與保安 → 定位服務：開啟佢，再喺清單入面開啟你嘅瀏覽器。",
"On Windows: Settings → Privacy & security → Location: turn on Location services and “Let desktop apps access your location”.":"喺 Windows：設定 → 私隱與安全性 → 位置：開啟定位服務同「允許桌面應用程式存取你的位置」。",
"Your browser allows Momento, but your computer’s location is turned off. $1 Then close and reopen the browser and try again, or type the venue instead.":"你個瀏覽器允許 Momento，但係電腦嘅位置功能關咗。$1 然後關咗瀏覽器再打開試，或者直接輸入場地。",
"Location is blocked for Momento. Click the icon left of the address bar, set Location to Allow and reload. If it still doesn’t work: $1 Or type the venue instead.":"Momento 嘅位置權限被封鎖咗。撳網址列左邊嘅圖示，將「位置」設為「允許」再重新載入。仲係唔得嘅話：$1 或者直接輸入場地。",
